  },
  {
   "t": 45.48,
   "end": 50.38,
   "text": "Twenty-five are common to all systems and there are thirty-six in Shadison."
  },
  {
   "t": 51.36,
   "end": 60.08,
   "text": "The method applied is to absorb the macrocosmic elements with the microcosmic ones, as we shall see."
  },
  {
   "t": 61.6,
   "end": 64.68,
   "text": "First, a brief introduction to the sutra."
  },
  {
   "t": 66.16,
   "end": 71.98,
   "text": "Now, the fruit of liberated isolation, kevalia, will be described,"
  },
