   "end": 75.62,
   "text": "which consists in the absorption of the pairs,"
  },
  {
   "t": 75.92,
   "end": 77.52,
   "text": "now I am not saying which pairs,"
  },
  {
   "t": 78.0,
   "end": 80.92,
   "text": "by merging them in oneness."
  },
  {
   "t": 82.18,
   "end": 83.34,
   "text": "And the sutra."
  },
  {
   "t": 91.1,
   "end": 94.62,
   "text": "By devouring the pairs of dualities,"
  },
  {
   "t": 95.46,
   "end": 99.32,
   "text": "there is establishment in the universal consciousness."
  },
  {
   "t": 101.1,
